"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Listen to the clues on the left.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Click on the box in the table that describes what Peter is referring to.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">There is only one answer per audio.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.", "type": "text"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "type": "TAB"}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le08ob04re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le08ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le08ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le08ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tHey Peter! How have you been? Any luck with the girls since the last time we spoke?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tTo be honest, I have no idea anymore. I've tried everything: online dating, speed dating, spending hours and hours in all the comic book stores in town \u2026 Honestly, nothing seems to work. So, last week I decided to see a psychic.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tAre you serious? That sounds totally out of character! You must be really desperate at this point! So, what did she see in her crystal ball?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tVery funny! She came up with a whole list of new activities I should try, actually. She said that I might find the girl of my dreams in a song.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tWhat does that even mean? She must be crazy!"}, {"time": "46200", "image": "engenn8le08ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI don't know about that, but I followed her advice and joined a choir.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tYou did what? You must be completely crazy, too.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tIt's a lot of fun, believe me. We practice every weekend in a big concert hall. I love how our voices echo in that huge space. The feeling is incredible.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tIt must make you feel good, I guess. Anyway, was the psychic right in the end?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tWell, there's this girl ..."}, {"time": "75000", "image": "engenn8le08ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tPlease tell me you have her number!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tAlmost. She whispered in my ear when we were singing, so I couldn't hear the last digit.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tShe must be waiting for you to call her then!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tIt's alright. I tried every combination until I got it right!"}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}]}], "type": "sena"}